Package: dsh-desktop
Version: 1.2.3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0, curl
Recommends: nodejs, npm
Maintainer: cuteG41cute <cuteG41cute@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: DeepSeek Harness Desktop (native GTK/WebKitGTK window)
 DeepSeek Harness WebUI as a native desktop window: auto-starts the dsh
 web service, opens a WebKitGTK window (no browser), stops the service
 when the window closes. Single instance, versioned, MIT licensed.
